One of the problems I've had surviving as a Tourist
has been that if the initial darts aren't blessed, they
can run out before I find a decent melee weapon
and/or gain enough HP to survive melee combat.
But even 12 uncursed +2 darts is generally good
enough to get past the first dungeon level or two.

Tourist, however, is really only a difficult role in
the early game.  If you make it to the quest as a
Tourist, the game is your burrito.

